{"seq":16,"slug":"go-service-engineering","title":"Go 服务工程化","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Go 服务工程化 简介\n\n会写 Go 语法之外，把一个 Go 服务结构好、测好、跑稳在生产，是另一层工程能力。本 hub 面向用 Go 做后端服务/BFF 的工程师，从项目结构与装配（项目布局、配置管理、依赖装配）讲起，覆盖错误与日志（错误处理与包装、结构化日志 slog、panic 与恢复）、测试（表驱动测试、mock 与接口、集成测试），以及生产运行（优雅关闭、可观测性接入、中间件模式）。它补足 `07_go-language`（语言层）与刚建的 `go-concurrency-patterns`（并发层）之外的「服务工程」一层。贯穿全篇的工程纪律是：善用 internal 封装、按特性组织、构造注入让代码可测、错误包装保留上下文、用 slog 做结构化可观测的日志、表驱动测试 + 真实依赖的集成测试、优雅关闭与中间件统一横切关注点。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-structure","title":"Project Structure","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/project-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-layout","title":"Go 项目布局","url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/project-structure/project-layout"},{"seq":2,"slug":"config-management","title":"配置管理","url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/project-structure/config-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-wiring","title":"依赖装配","url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/project-structure/dependency-wiring"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"errors-and-logging","title":"Errors And Logging","docCount":3,"url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/errors-and-logging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-handling-wrapping","title":"错误处理与包装","url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/errors-and-logging/error-handling-wrapping"},{"seq":2,"slug":"structured-logging-slog","title":"结构化日志与 slog","url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/errors-and-logging/structured-logging-slog"},{"seq":3,"slug":"panics-and-recovery","title":"Panic 与恢复","url":"/h/languages/go-service-engineering/errors-and-logging/panics-and-recovery"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing","title":"Testing","docCount":3,"url":"/h/l